[4.361, "o", "\u001b[1;32minfo:\u001b"]
[0.017, "o", "[0m Creating a Ruyi virtual environment at \u001b[32mvenv-llvm-ruyisdk\u001b[0m...\r\n"]
[7.007, "o", "\u001b[1;32minfo:\u001b[0m The virtual en"]
[0.016, "o", "vironment is now created.\r\n\r\nYou may activate it by sourcing the appropriat"]
[0.000, "o", "e activation script in the\r\n\u001b[32mbin\u001b[0m directory, and deactivate by invoking `ruyi-deactivate`.\r\n\r\nA fresh "]
[0.016, "o", "sysroot/prefix is also provisioned in the virtual environment."]
[0.000, "o", "\r\nIt is available at the following path:\r\n\r\n    \u001b[32m/home/ubuntu/venv-llvm-ruyisdk/sysroot\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nThe virtual environment "]
[0.016, "o", "also comes with ready-made CMake toolchain file\r\nand Meson cros"]
[0.000, "o", "s file. Check the virtual environment root for those;\r\ncomments in the files contain usage instructions.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.240, "o", "\u001b[?2004hu"]
[0.016, "o", "buntu@ubuntu:~$ "]
